Modifications: twelve upstream skills were merged into one skill with references. The
three per-hop migration skills became a shared workflow in SKILL.md plus one overview
per hop; their per-area reference files were copied with renamed files, contents lists,
and a corrected file-based-app directive entry. The .NET 10 to 11 material was marked
prerelease and extended with breaking changes Microsoft documented after Preview 3
(through RC 2). The AOT, Thread.Abort, SDK-style and six test-migration skills were
condensed to about half their length; the xUnit and NUnit mapping cheatsheets were
folded into their references. Corrections: SYSLIB0046 is not Thread.Interrupt,
JsonSerializerContext is a base class rather than an attribute, UnconditionalSuppressMessage
is allowed with a proven justification, packages.config migration has no dotnet CLI
command, Upgrade Assistant is deprecated, and TargetFramework is no longer set in
Directory.Build.props examples. Upstream eval contracts, workspace-path rules,
cross-skill links and frontmatter routing text were removed.
